BlueSky plugin bridging the BlueSky air traffic simulator to Frequentis's
ras-manager (Restricted Airspace Service). Consumes UASZone restricted-
airspace definitions from ras-manager and enforces them as BlueSky
geofenced areas, honoring each zone's altitude band, restriction type and
time-window applicability.

Drop-in plugin: once installed, BlueSky automatically discovers it from
the shared plugin directory. Load it with "PLUGIN LOAD FRQ_RAS" (or add
FRQ_RAS to enabled_plugins in settings.cfg); it then runs automatically,
with no further stack command needed.
